 "remarks": "A rare find! Welcome to this bright and beautifully updated contemporary ranch, perfectly sited on a gorgeous, level, and highly usable property. Meticulously maintained and thoughtfully enhanced by its current owners, this move-in ready home offers the ease of one-level living with modern updates throughout. The main level features a desirable open-concept layout, seamlessly connecting the kitchen, living room, and dining area. The spacious primary en-suite includes a private bath, complemented by two additional bedrooms on the main floor. The expansive walk-out lower level offers exceptional flexibility, featuring the perfect space for a home office, au pair suite, or in-law living area, with a large full bath. Recent improvements include, but are not limited to, a new oil tank, updated appliances, new gutters, landscape, and new lower-level and garage flooring. Located on one of North Stamford's most coveted streets, this is a rare opportunity to own an updated home in a premier setting with a beautiful flat yard, convenient to Stamford, New Canaan, Greenwich, and Bedford.",
